# Keep build context small and avoid copying host build artifacts / secrets.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/*.log
.git
.github
test-logs
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.local
.DS_Store

# SECRETS THE CHECKOUT HOLDS AND NO IMAGE MAY (workplan 0167 T7 review). The
# images build from the repository root with `COPY . .`, so a file git ignores
# because it holds a secret is in every image built on a stack unless it is
# named here too. The pooler's user list holds pgbouncer_auth's password in
# plain text (ensure-env-secrets.sh writes it), and that role may run the
# lookup that returns any role's password verifier. `**/.env` and `**/.env.*`
# above cover .env, its backups and its temporary files.
# scripts/a-secret-the-image-copied.unit.test.ts holds this list to .gitignore's.
deploy/compose/pgbouncer/userlist.txt
